  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRC-supported YRCS Primary Health Centres (IPACT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRC will channel its support to Output&#xa0;2 of&#xa0;DRC&#x2019;s&#xa0;IPACT project&#xa0;(Integrated Programme for Affected Communities Transformation). 
The project&#x2019;s&#xa0;overall&#xa0;objective&#xa0;is to meet the immediate humanitarian needs in&#xa0;water, hygiene, health and psychosocial support&#xa0;of IDPs and vulnerable communities in Yemen.&#xa0;
Output 2 focuses on&#xa0;access to&#xa0;primary healthcare and community health services&#xa0;provided at YRCS Primary Health Centres (PHCs) to IDPs and vulnerable households in two target communities&#xa0;(Raymah al-Jibaan&#xa0;and&#xa0;Sayoun)&#xa0;
The project will provide those PHCs with medicines, consumables, equipment, running costs and staff/volunteer incentives according to YRCS&#x2019; standard package of support. If identified as a need, further repair or rehabilitation works may also be provided.</narrative>
  </description>
